OL,3,GNEWSAEighty-three-year-old wins
OL,4,Aprestigious art prize
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 83-year-old artist from mid Wales
OL,7,Fhas won one of the world's most
OL,8,Fprestigious international art
OL,9,Fcompetitions.
OL,11,FYvonne Crossley from Llandrindod Wells,
OL,12,FPowys, was awarded the #15,000 Trinity
OL,13,FBuoy Wharf Drawing Prize, for her
OL,14,Fwinning work Octogenarian Dancer.
OL,16,FThe suspended wire figure, made from
OL,17,Fused wire and fishing wire, captures a
OL,18,Fdancer's poise without arms or legs,
OL,19,Fand is a celebration of what her body
OL,20,Fcan still do in her 80s, Crossley said.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,440,430,260,140,0,100
